  "_recoveryNote": "Weapon skill no longer scales attack recovery (owner veto, round 2): recovery is animation timing and stats do not touch the feel constants. Skill buys the damage-range position, stamina cost, gear wear and bow handling.",
  "_scoreNote": "`score` is the attribute Morrowind's own formula for this check names, which is frequently NOT `gov` (Security is governed by Intelligence and rolled on Agility; every school casts through Willpower). `gov` sets the trainer cap and the practice discount only. A skill with no `score` is a pure-skill check in canon too - armour rating, unarmoured and acrobatics take no attribute term."
